  "body": "Hi. By applying definitions of [registrable domain](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#host-registrable-domain) and [schemelessly same site](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#schemelessly-same-site) algorithms I cannot get how could we complete with ✅ mark at **first three rows** for `schemelessly same site` column? With knowledge that  `example.com` **is not** a public prefix we may conclude that:\r\n\r\n-  Step 2.2. of the algorithm cannot be applied since `hostA` and `hostB` are not equal\r\n-  Step 2.3. of the algorithm cannot be applied since `hostA` and `hostB` have same registrable domain which is `null`\r\n\r\nFor instance:\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#example-same-site\r\n\r\n> \\(\"https\", \"example\\.com\"\\)\t\\(\"http\", \"non\\-secure\\.example\\.com\"\\)\t✅\t❌\r\n\r\nDid I miss something 🤔",
